PikminRecomp: infer vertex array extents from indices when GXSetArray size is 0.
The GameCube SDK never passes an array size; uploading a guessed size is either wrong or wasteful.

diff --git a/include/dolphin/gx/GXAurora.h b/include/dolphin/gx/GXAurora.h
